  "description": "Base / Home Port: Spain, South Of France and Italy\nOperating Area: Italy, France, Corsica, Sardinia, Spain, U.S. Virgin Islands, British Virgin Islands, Bahamas, Leeward Islands, Windward Islands\n\nThe 30.48m (100‘0“) luxury performance cruiser L´ Hippocampe (ex. Varsovie) was built by Nautor´s Swan at their Pietarsaarishipyard in Finland in 2008. She is a pedigree sailing yacht with an elegant interior and exterior design by a revered design house German Frers. In 2024, she underwent an extensive refit and is now in top-tier condition, ready to take her charter guests on new sailing adventures in comfort and style. L´ Hippocampe was built to be easy to sail and offers excellent sail handling. The yacht easily reaches speeds of 10 knots+ and regularly achieves 240 miles of sailing in a day. Modified from the Swan 100S version features a coach roof raised at the front, giving additional forward-facing salon windows and an additional 5in of headroom in the engine room.",
